# RCA F3: the two rules above never matched anything real. pyquotex writes its
# broker session cache to a directory named `pyquotex_sessions/`, and the
# backend also drops a `session.json` next to its own code. Both contain a
# live 40-char SSID plus `laravel_session` / `remember_web_*` cookies, and four
# of them were committed. Ignore the actual paths.
pyquotex_sessions/
backend/session.json
# Per-user runtime state: encrypted broker sessions, trade history, runtime
